{"ID":"20240504161426-krso975","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504161426-krso975","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504161426-krso975\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620130708-1xwld1v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617091136-59jwqfw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620130544-3qebewo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"090屈草","type":"doc","updated":"20240808160001"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240808155952-4fj88e1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808155952-4fj88e1","updated":"20240808160001"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240617091151-4abatmr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091151-4abatmr"}},{"ID":"20240617091152-eekeniz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091152-eekeniz","updated":"20240617091156"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091152-m2kvtqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091152-m2kvtqq","updated":"20240617091152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。主胸胁下痛，邪气，腹问寒热阴痹。久服，轻身益气，耐老（《御览》作补益能老）。生川泽（旧在《唐本草》中无毒，今增）。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091152-puexuu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091152-puexuu6","updated":"20240617091152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生汉中，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091152-t8h7hz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091152-t8h7hz9","updated":"20240617091152"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案陶宏景云：方药不复用，俗无识者。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091222-n0w7bkv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091222-n0w7bkv"}},{"ID":"20240617091223-530flkp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091223-530flkp","updated":"20240617091228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091223-0go1ay5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091223-0go1ay5","updated":"20240617091223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，无毒。主胸胁下痛，邪气，肠间寒热，阴痹。久服轻身，益气耐老，生汉中川泽，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091244-xglqgx2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091244-xglqgx2"}},{"ID":"20240617091245-tipb0hf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091245-tipb0hf","updated":"20240617091251"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091245-vwv94x7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091245-vwv94x7","updated":"20240617091245"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"微寒，无毒．生汉中．五月采．"}]},{"ID":"20240617091245-yaxw6hr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091245-yaxw6hr","updated":"20240617091256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶屈草，味苦．主胸胁下痛邪气，肠间寒热阴痹．久服，轻身益气耐老．生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091233-fiiokoi","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091233-fiiokoi"}},{"ID":"20240617091235-uurenv8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091235-uurenv8","updated":"20240617091239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091235-psfh54v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091235-psfh54v","updated":"20240617091235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，无毒。主胸胁下痛，邪气，肠间寒热，阴痹。久服轻身益气、耐老。生汉中川泽，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091235-2ztxpcf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091235-2ztxpcf","updated":"20240617091235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药不复用，俗无识者也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091201-q5dm1x3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091201-q5dm1x3"}},{"ID":"20240617091202-8hhi00w","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091202-8hhi00w","updated":"20240617091207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091202-bph5rvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091202-bph5rvw","updated":"20240617091202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，无毒。主胸胁下痛，邪气，肠间寒热，阴痹。久服轻身益气，耐老。生汉中川泽，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091202-ai6d7ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091202-ai6d7ng","updated":"20240617091202"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶方∶药不复用，俗无识者。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135431-lidbwb9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135431-lidbwb9"}},{"ID":"20240607135435-v7ikp8r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135435-v7ikp8r","updated":"20240607135445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135435-ufy1qgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135435-ufy1qgc","updated":"20240607135435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒，无毒。主治胸胁下痛，邪气，肠间寒热，阴痹。久服轻身，益气耐老。生汉中川泽。五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135435-dbfvqdg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135435-dbfvqdg","updated":"20240607135435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方药不复用，世无识者也。（《新修》三六五页，《大观》卷三○，《政和》五四六页）"}]},{"ID":"20240607135436-rvoskuc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135436-rvoskuc"}},{"ID":"20240607135454-vpmsye0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607135454-vpmsye0","updated":"20240607135501"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240607135454-ns8c415","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607135454-ns8c415","updated":"20240607135454"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，微寒。无毒。主胸胁下痛邪气，肠间寒热阴痹。久服益气，轻身耐老。"}]},{"ID":"20240607135454-fz75udq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607135454-fz75udq"}},{"ID":"20240617091135-g01ijaq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617091135-g01ijaq","updated":"20240617091145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈草《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240617091135-b62ewz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091135-b62ewz7","updated":"20240617091135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦，主胸胁下痛，邪气，腹间寒热，阴痹，久服轻身，益气耐老，生川泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091135-jbaa0e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091135-jbaa0e2","updated":"20240617091135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"屈轶尧庭，均荣一借，息卧愆时，阴阳沦谢，濯濯虚鸣，油油就化，雪栈屏山，访宜午夏。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091135-u70wjgq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091135-u70wjgq","updated":"20240617091135"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"帝王世纪：黄帝时有草生庭，佞人入则指之，名曰屈轶。张友正赋：傥一借于吹嘘，愿均荣于动植。黄帝素问：背胸邪系阴阳左右，胸胁痛而不得息，不得卧。又大肠病者，肠中切痛而鸣濯濯。元结歌：元化油油兮，谁知其然。陆游诗：雪栈屏山日月游。名医曰：生汉中，五月采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617091135-fbje4mh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617091135-fbje4mh"}},{"ID":"20240617091136-59jwqfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617091136-59jwqfw"}}]}